From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: pocket-s2: configure sound card and jack polarity

Set normally-closed headphone and ground jack switches for WCD939x.
Jack polarity change adapted from rafalrojek's Armada PR #663:
https://github.com/armada-os/armada/pull/663

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-ayaneo-ps2.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8650-ayaneo-ps2.dts
@@ -12,6 +12,15 @@
 	compatible = "ayaneo,pocket-s2", "qcom,sm8650";
 };
 
+&{/sound} {
+	compatible = "ayaneo,pocket-s2-sndcard";
+};
+
+&wcd939x {
+	qcom,hphl-jack-type-normally-closed;
+	qcom,ground-jack-type-normally-closed;
+};
+
 &i2c4 {
 	touchscreen@5d {
 		reg = <0x5d>;
